{"_v":1,"id":"midnight-in-the-garden-of-good-and-evil-2024","bd":{"positive":1,"mixed":1,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Chris Jones","o":"Chicago Tribune","s":66,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"/people/Chris-Jones/","q":"Like many pre-Broadway tryouts, it has its strengths and weaknesses and a wildly uneven second half of a second act that suggests everyone simply ran out of enough time to fashion an ending that really satisfies."},{"cn":"Rachel Weinberg","o":"BroadwayWorld","s":74,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"/chicago/article/Review-MIDNIGHT-IN-THE-GARDEN-OF-GOOD-AND-EVIL-WORLD-PREMIERE-MUSICAL-at-Goodman-Theatre-20240709","q":"MIDNIGHT is a visual marvel. Oram’s sets and James’s costumes are gorgeous. Lighting designers Neil Austin and Jamie Platt also have particularly astute work; I appreciated the horror movie vibes of the lighting in the second act ensemble number “Reasonable Doubt,” in which the townspeople debate Williams’s guilt."}],"pd":"2024-06-25","ca":[{"n":"Vasily Andrewsky","r":"Russian Art Singer"},{"n":"Alice Ankers","r":"American Ballet"},{"n":"Miriam Avendale","r":"American Ballet"},{"n":"Chester Bennett","r":"Gentleman of the Ensemble"},{"n":"Ima Berline","r":"American Ballet"},{"n":"Hal Bird","r":"Gentleman of the Ensemble"},{"n":"Dorothy Booth","r":"American Ballet"},{"n":"Marion Booth","r":"American Ballet"},{"n":"Helen Bowers","r":"American Ballet"},{"n":"Phoebe Brune","r":"Natasha"},{"n":"Konstantin Buketoff","r":"Russian Art Singer"},{"n":"Hugh Cameron","r":"Nicholas"},{"n":"Adelaide Candee","r":"American Ballet"},{"n":"Terry Carroll","r":"American Ballet"},{"n":"Blanche Collins","r":"Olga"},{"n":"Ann Constance","r":"American Ballet"},{"n":"William Cooper","r":"Gentleman of the Ensemble"},{"n":"Betty Credito","r":"American Ballet"},{"n":"Louise Dalberg","r":"An Avenger"},{"n":"Greek Evans","r":"Konstantin"},{"n":"Lotta Fanning","r":"American Ballet"},{"n":"Paul Florence","r":"Gentleman of the Ensemble"},{"n":"Bernard Gorcey","r":"Count Boris"},{"n":"Mary G